<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 30 bln Skr seven day T-bill.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 30 bln Skr seven day T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of 30 billion crowns of seven day Treasury bills.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on May 7, it said and bids are due by 0900 GMT on May 6.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
